{"sections":[{"slug":"可分闭包","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"可分闭包"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可分闭包</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"可分闭包"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">域</span>"}},{"Plain":" $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">的可分闭包是满足如下条件的域扩张</span> $F \\hookrightarrow F_S$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$F \\hookrightarrow F_S$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可分扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可分扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$F_S$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可分闭域","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可分闭域</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">取定</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数闭包","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数闭包</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\overline{F}$, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">的可分闭包也可定义为</span> $\\overline{F}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中在</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">上可分的元素构成的子域</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">域的可分闭包在同构意义下唯一</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但可能有非平凡的自同构</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}